...@../../../dev/d2/themes/assurance
vars: { d2-config: { layout-engine: tala;  pad: 70 } }
title: RETAINED CONTRACTS / CURRENT FINAL USE {
  shape: text
  near: top-center
  style.font-size: 32
  style.bold: true
}
parent: Required published parent\nExact source and Contract\nIndependently selected Session\nRetain approved requirements {
  class: card
  left: 0
  top: 0
  width: 490
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#eef3ef"
}
child: Selected inherited POO child\nActual C4 / Dataflow object\nSource-bound Session projection\nCannot select its own parent authority {
  class: card
  left: 700
  top: 0
  width: 490
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#eef3ef"
}
review: Authorization review contract\nExact Policy / schema / source pair\nBound Delta and replay evidence\nReview the actual publication parent {
  class: card
  left: 1400
  top: 0
  width: 490
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#e7edf4"
}
combined: Effective functional requirement\nRequired parent AND selected child\nPreserve actual source projections\nFresh assessment at each new effect {
  class: card
  left: 350
  top: 450
  width: 490
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#e7edf4"
}
gateway: Gateway contract join\nOriginal profile / claim / domains\nCurrent publication and owner\nBound review at authority CAS {
  class: card
  left: 1050
  top: 450
  width: 490
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#e7edf4"
}
durable: Durable original consumption\nCanonical claim and reservation\nDispatch burn and pending range\nRecovered committed prefix {
  class: card
  left: 0
  top: 900
  width: 490
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#f4f2ec"
}
rust: Rust final execution owner\nFresh check after every wait\nSerialize actual callback / enqueue\nCompletion commit follows insertion {
  class: card
  icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/rust.svg
  icon.near: top-left
  left: 700
  top: 900
  width: 490
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#e7edf4"
}
output: Bounded queue / transport\nOnly admitted buffers may drain\nOne-use native capability\nReceipt is an observation {
  class: card
  left: 1400
  top: 900
  width: 490
  height: 240
  style.fill: "#f4f2ec"
}
unknown: Unknown or interrupted result\nKeep original claim and hold\nPreserve range / consumed prefix\nNo replay and no inferred refund {
  class: card
  left: 700
  top: 1370
  width: 490
  height: 220
  style.fill: "#f4f2ec"
}
parent -> combined: Retained requirement { style.font-size: 18 }
child -> combined: Selected requirement { style.font-size: 18 }
combined -> gateway: Strengthening contract { style.font-size: 18 }
review -> gateway: Bound evidence { style.font-size: 18 }
gateway -> rust: Current deciding view { style.font-size: 18 }
durable -> rust: Installed original prefix { style.font-size: 18 }
rust -> output: Guarded final admission { style.font-size: 18 }
rust -> unknown: Failure / revoke / lost completion {
  style.font-size: 18
  style.stroke-dash: 5
}
footer: "A root proof does not retain every parent · Preserve the selected commitments\nA solver report is not a send permit · Unknown exposure remains held" {
  shape: text
  left: 250
  top: 1740
  width: 1450
  height: 100
  style.font-size: 24
  style.font-color: "#5c8b77"
}

